### 1. Create School Announcement
POST {{communicationUrl}}/announcements
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "title": "Opening Day Notice",
  "message": "Term 1 officially opens on Friday 10th April 2026 at 10:00 AM.",
  "targetAudience": "Parents",
  "postedBy": "{{userId}}",
  "sendViaSms": true
}

### 2. Get Announcements by School
GET {{communicationUrl}}/announcements/school/{{schoolId}}?targetAudience=Parents
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 3. Get Announcement by ID
GET {{communicationUrl}}/announcements/{{announcementId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 4. Update School Announcement
PATCH {{communicationUrl}}/announcements/{{announcementId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Closing Day Notice",
  "message": "Term 1 officially closes on Friday 10th April 2026 at 11:00 AM."
}

### 5. Send Direct Message
POST {{communicationUrl}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderId": "{{userId}}",
  "receiverId": "{{recipientId}}",
  "messageText": "Hello, I would like to discuss John's math progress this term."
}

### 6. Get User Inbox
GET {{communicationUrl}}/messages/inbox/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 7. Get Conversation Thread Between Two Users
GET {{communicationUrl}}/messages/conversation/{{userId}}/{{recipientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 8. Get Direct Message by ID
GET {{communicationUrl}}/messages/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 9. Mark Direct Message as Read
PATCH {{communicationUrl}}/messages/{{messageId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 10. Delete Announcement
DELETE {{communicationUrl}}/announcements/{{announcementId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 11. Delete Direct Message
DELETE {{communicationUrl}}/messages/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}